    {"record_id":"T-LVL","role":"teaching_asset","title":"微课：先给关系写出“谁—怎样—什么”","target_skill_ids":["xingce.judgment.analogy.relation_level"],"candidate_misconception_ids":["M-LVL"],"independence_group":"analogy-level-teaching","content_origin":"original_lumi","review_status":"draft_unreviewed","target_candidate_ids":["M-LVL"],"teaching_content":"把词组改写成一句带位置的关系：例如“鸟卵经过孵化”。选项若只给出最终对象、地点或部件，就没有保留原关系中的过程层级。先判断每个词在关系中扮演什么位置，再比较选项。","record_sha256":"4c5c582d4f20df5df3944a49411b1c7b4dbf4ddff5d88135c8bb40838e169608"},
