    {"record_id":"T-SURF","role":"teaching_asset","title":"微课：同一场景不等于同一关系","target_skill_ids":["xingce.judgment.analogy.relation_evidence"],"candidate_misconception_ids":["M-SURF"],"independence_group":"analogy-surface-teaching","content_origin":"original_lumi","review_status":"draft_unreviewed","target_candidate_ids":["M-SURF"],"teaching_content":"先遮住词的领域含义，只比较关系句能否替换。巢穴和鸟卵同属鸟类场景，但“鸟卵在巢穴中”不是“鸟卵经过孵化”。优先选择能复述同一关系动词和方向的选项。","record_sha256":"5d64a12910c991cce321cc8ba36fb229619de6aacb82a3867c316700bad20a49"},
